[{"title":"题商山四皓","author":"陈颢","text":"嬴秦虐燄不可触，衣冠往往逃空谷。\n皤然须发四老翁，高卧商颜谢尘俗。\n炎精奋起天地宽，蒲轮就聘来长安。\n虽云误落子房计，终为高鸿成羽翰。\n羽翰既成大事毕，还踏山中旧行迹。\n松阴满地生微凉，一局枯棋消永日。\n局终人去今昔非，云山寂寂空猿啼。\n临风展画三叹息，一曲共谁歌紫芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32409,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹邻子歌","author":"陈颢","text":"竹邻子，何许人，云是落托穷乡民。\n柴门半掩堪罗雀，布衣百结如悬鹑。\n囊间有钱即沽酒，甑中无米从生尘。\n读书不多虑事浅，发言往往遭众嗔。\n独行独止无与友，拂石醉卧苍厓垠。\n忽梦数君子，玉立而长身。\n口云出自渭川族，托迹今居汉水滨。\n冰霜风雨不改色，梅仙髯史吾同伦。\n闻君失意众所弃，吾独爱之求与邻。\n但多酿酒对君饮，日日清风扫户新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32410,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"陈颢","text":"湘江玉一枝，风节清如许。\n扫榻致秋阴，鹧鸪啼暮雨。\n直节从来瘦，虚心本自清。\n凉风屋头起，叶叶是秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32411,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇送友人","author":"陈颢","text":"美人久不见，此地偶相过。\n复送扁舟去，其如别思何。\n草香汀雨湿，花暝树烟多。\n后夜苏台上，谁同一醉歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32412,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答张道士","author":"陈颢","text":"见说辞京国，端居又一年。\n诗瓢寒挂月，丹灶煖生烟。\n谢俗怡清淡，探玄论白坚。\n何时造林下，煮茗试山泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32413,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春言怀寄友","author":"陈颢","text":"十日九风雨，吟边无好春。\n怀人望南浦，借酒问西邻。\n野性陶潜懒，交情鲍叔真。\n几时连榻话，一洗寸心尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32414,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画扇次岑琬韵","author":"陈颢","text":"自适閒边趣，谁言分外求。\n看山一瓢酒，载月五湖舟。\n秋水清吟思，西风冷钓裘。\n惟应陆甫里，千古可同流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32415,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云轩为月上人赋","author":"陈颢","text":"高僧忘世相，缚屋就云深。\n静看千峰白，幽栖半榻阴。\n卷舒虽有态，去住本无心。\n我亦求閒者，何时一访寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32416,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春陇耕云","author":"陈颢","text":"耕业依先陇，遗安属隐君。\n绿畴三寸雨，黄犊一犁云。\n草际春阴合，花边晓色分。\n鹿门有高士，端可与同群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32417,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒潭钓雪","author":"陈颢","text":"岁晏风兼雪，扁舟驻钓滩。\n瑶花半篷湿，柳絮一蓑寒。\n子厚偏攻咏，玄真苦避官。\n如何渭滨叟，头白谢渔竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32418,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松室调琴","author":"陈颢","text":"一室大如斗，床留三尺琴。\n苍松存古操，灵籁发遗音。\n鹤语惊秋冷，乌啼觉夜深。\n惟应贞白叟，会取伯牙心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32419,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬申正月晦日夜梦至僧舍遇一老叟云欲于静处少休予应之曰借来云半榻睡起日三竿觉而枕上足成","author":"陈颢","text":"渐老疏尘事，心清身亦安。\n借来云半榻，睡起日三竿。\n松火炉头煖，风波屋外寒。\n行藏皆梦里，何必问邯郸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32420,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滴翠峰","author":"陈颢","text":"一峰高竦秀，不与众峰邻。\n翠滴虚岚晓，青含太古春。\n祥烟生几席，爽气逼衣巾。\n绝顶谁能上，巍然隔世氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32421,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涵碧池","author":"陈颢","text":"凿地为方沼，层峦四面围。\n天光涵古镜，苔色上春衣。\n幽鸟情相契，閒云影倒飞。\n谁安一拳石，比作钓鱼矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32422,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彩虹桥","author":"陈颢","text":"垒石为梁柱，凭谁号彩虹。\n烟云遮不断，霄汉步应通。\n涧草寒留碧，山花暖衬红。\n此中豪迈气，不愧茂陵翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32423,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞洞","author":"陈颢","text":"路从林谷转，门向石岩开。\n晴色薰瑶草，丹光映碧苔。\n固应无锁钥，疑别有楼台。\n欲扣长生诀，仙翁跨鹤来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32424,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫芝径","author":"陈颢","text":"万壑千岩里，幽深一径通。\n紫芝生奕奕，香雾湿濛濛。\n托隐商颜迹，遗芳谢氏风。\n肯容閒客采，短策儗相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32425,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍松坞","author":"陈颢","text":"一簇烟霞岛，周遭尽植松。\n蓬莱元不远，弱水自应通。\n翠滴林梢露，寒生石罅风。\n茯苓如可斸，早晚约仙翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32426,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧云岩","author":"陈颢","text":"翠岩云借宿，与客共閒心。\n石榻春生暖，萝房昼作阴。\n氤氲飘素练，窈窕接青林。\n那得长留卧，苍生望雨霖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32427,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流香涧","author":"陈颢","text":"泉脉来何许，萦回下曲塘。\n雨过平涨绿，花落暗流香。\n石面凝春暖，松根漱晚凉。\n高歌濯缨客，何必问沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32428,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题友云水墨画以唐人不雨山长润无云水自阴为画景遂次其韵题之","author":"陈颢","text":"看画晴窗里，萧然净俗心。\n鸟声春寂寂，岚气昼阴阴。\n门俯沧洲迥，船移别浦深。\n令人想风致，飞梦到云林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32429,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中写怀","author":"陈颢","text":"草径通村入，茅茨傍水安。\n贫知身计拙，瘦觉带围宽。\n花雨沾苔湿，茶烟入竹寒。\n无人会心事，默坐自弹冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32430,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡起偶成","author":"陈颢","text":"昼长幽禽惊梦醒，起向松窗汲寒井。\n隔竹惟闻犬吠声，竹深似见人行影。\n我贫无力种山田，多病翻成半月眠。\n莫是相怜来访者，旧券从添赊酒钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32431,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日写怀","author":"陈颢","text":"东风吹雨著轻尘，芳草茸茸湿翠茵。\n寒食过来犹自冷，海棠开后不多春。\n山中谩忆陶弘景，谷口谁寻郑子真。\n圣代只今同化育，沧溟不信有穷鳞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32432,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿大云寺留题竹深处","author":"陈颢","text":"日暮寻幽到竹深，竹烟晴锁寺门阴。\n苔荒路绝行人迹，月出潭空静者心。\n清供一盂香积饭，閒情半榻白云衾。\n留诗已与青山约，莫厌频来访道林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32433,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日客怀","author":"陈颢","text":"江国冬来十日阴，闭门高卧拥寒衾。\n贫将乞米无颜帖，客久思家有越吟。\n雪压荒桥行路断，山藏老树冻云深。\n百壶安得如渑酒，细与梅花说旧心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32434,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春遣兴","author":"陈颢","text":"柴门地僻懒衣巾，閒看行云到水滨。\n花片流香通曲涧，树阴分绿护山邻。\n苏张谩骋纵横术，巢许甘为隐逸民。\n独立斜阳思无限，不知何处是通津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32435,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢朱士章惠墨","author":"陈颢","text":"锦囊封墨到山居，知是蓬莱贡献馀。\n云气晓寒生笔砚，松胶价重抵璠玙。\n山人借录归田稿，野叟分抄种树书。\n珍重交情无以报，寸缄聊为寄双鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32436,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过阊门望虎丘作","author":"陈颢","text":"平生未识虎丘山，此日经过不暇攀。\n泉石佳期随处有，古今清赏几人閒。\n楼台影落春云外，钟鼓声来夕照间。\n独倚帆樯遥注目，客怀空羡鹤飞还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32437,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭中表弟张秉","author":"陈颢","text":"十年辛苦事遗编，抱病那知竟不痊。\n黄土一抔今古恨，青山半世弟兄缘。\n草堂春去思无梦，竹屋云深榻自悬。\n莫话少年平昔语，夜深风雨到灯前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32438,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和答鉴中上人","author":"陈颢","text":"闻说高居似道林，俗流无地得相寻。\n菩提子落空岩静，优钵花开古径深。\n身外利名忘得失，眼中乌兔任升沈。\n遥知一榻跏趺处，勘破西来佛祖心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32439,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿吴江泗洲寺值主僧不在留题","author":"陈颢","text":"客舟来泊古招提，落日吴江望欲迷。\n茅屋几家村远近，野桥危木水东西。\n茶烟暝护萝房榻，花雨香沾石磴泥。\n不遇高僧谁共语，新诗谩向壁间题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32440,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游海虞城中","author":"陈颢","text":"琴川风物旧如何，此日乘閒试一过。\n海邑官清无狱讼，土城风古有弦歌。\n言公井畔苍梧老，虞仲山前白石多。\n谢此高僧留我宿，暝随猿鸟入烟萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32441,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊吴江塔寺主僧留饭","author":"陈颢","text":"塔寺东南湖水长，三高亭下晚风凉。\n鲤鱼出没杨花白，鸥鸟浮沈杜若香。\n僧喜诗人留共语，商随渔叟泊连樯。\n丁宁黄帽休贪懒，早理征帆候曙光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32442,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋次韵","author":"陈颢","text":"江涵秋影雁南过，凉思催人可奈何。\n林下久知尘事少，水边惟爱月明多。\n吴乡鲈美应分鲙，楚客衣单自制荷。\n回首沧浪濯缨处，高情惭愧钓鱼蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32443,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉宫秋","author":"陈颢","text":"汉宫移植近庭隅，妆点秋容锦不如。\n罗扇凉生萤歇后，金茎露滴雁来初。\n昭阳宿酒酣飞燕，长信秋风老婕妤。\n零落当时守宫血，清霜几度为消除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32444,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登云晓望","author":"陈颢","text":"十丈金鳌白玉阑，偶来乘兴一跻攀。\n月沈萧寺烟钟外，日出沧洲水树间。\n野鸟无声随客去，海风随阵打潮还。\n回头却羡云庵叟，扫地焚香独自閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32445,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妙峰夕霁","author":"陈颢","text":"长廊钟磬寂无声，帘捲西风看晚晴。\n池色倒涵天镜碧，霞光斜照佛龛明。\n扣禅客去云留宿，乞米僧归鹤出迎。\n却忆旧来分榻夜，卧听檐雨滴三更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32446,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜听雨写怀","author":"陈颢","text":"风声杂雨夜潇潇，倦枕昏灯梦寐劳。\n报国丹心徒自许，欺人华发不相抛。\n池塘春草无新句，篱落寒花只旧交。\n起看床头三尺剑，尚馀豪气拂云梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32447,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸿门宴","author":"陈颢","text":"两雄秋色与南山，决计鸿门一会间。\n?醁徒能浇虎士，干将那得犯龙颜。\n雪飞双斗尊前失，天护单车灞上还。\n明日咸阳风物改，有人衣绣忆乡关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32448,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"踏车妇","author":"陈颢","text":"破裙风飏足移频，长夏随夫历苦辛。\n那似美人梳洗罢，一钩罗袜步香尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32449,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻邻家机声","author":"陈颢","text":"竹里人家笑语稀，日长少妇学鸣机。\n藁砧应是归来早，二月催裁白苧衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32450,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜闻邻童读书","author":"陈颢","text":"风送吾伊隔竹声，邻童应解对韩檠。\n我怀髫发从师日，翻笑于今学未成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32451,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新寒望授衣不至","author":"陈颢","text":"霜露园林木叶稀，客边望断寄来衣。\n遥知慈母怜儿冷，织尽寒更未下机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32452,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春","author":"陈颢","text":"萧条书剑客边身，望望归期过立春。\n官柳渐黄梅已白，东风应笑未归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32453,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中友人见访","author":"陈颢","text":"别来南北寸心悬，到得相逢二竖缠。\n欲典春衣沽酒共，不禁憔悴向人前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32454,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋蝶","author":"陈颢","text":"粉褪香消力渐微，多情犹自舞斜晖。\n野花篱落西风冷，不比春园得意飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32455,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋萤","author":"陈颢","text":"寒光一点映松萝，零落西风恨更多。\n莫向波间照秋影，满溪凉雨颤残荷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32456,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠琵琶老妓","author":"陈颢","text":"玉容憔悴减风流，犹抱琵琶半掩羞。\n莫向湓城寻旧迹，荻花枫叶不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32457,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋山行李图","author":"陈颢","text":"千山落叶万山云，行到荒桥日已昏。\n羡杀田家头白叟，半生足不离柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32458,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔舟夜归图","author":"陈颢","text":"罢钓归来月未明，隔篱遥见一灯青。\n不知潮落江风转，流却扁舟过别汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32459,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"陈颢","text":"渔网中流撒暝烟，江空雁叫雪晴天。\n锦鳞若得归须早，莫待风涛暮打船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32460,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅次韵","author":"陈颢","text":"孤根自是不凡材，却傍山村野水开。\n历尽岁寒冰雪苦，百花头上领春来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32461,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五马图","author":"陈颢","text":"校猎归来卸锦鞍，长林丰草夕阳间。\n龙媒不受盐车困，尽属皇家十二闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32462,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剪菊图","author":"陈颢","text":"西风三径近秋期，閒看山童理菊枝。\n浪蕊浮花都剪却，刚留几朵傲霜姿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32463,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"陈颢","text":"懒向秋风把钓竿，一瓢长醉水云间。\n无情白鸟还飞去，不及青山伴我閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32464,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屈原渔父问答","author":"陈颢","text":"众醉陶陶我独醒，此心于世已忘情。\n老翁不识孤臣意，谩向沧浪歌濯缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32465,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜闻雨雪","author":"陈颢","text":"坐阅残书夕未眠，危檐雨雪一灯前。\n不如呼酒陶然醉，免滴春愁到耳边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32466,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下海棠为姚会川题","author":"陈颢","text":"酡颜半醉殢春娇，拂袖东风暖雾消。\n十二栏杆月如昼，纱笼银烛不须烧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32467,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题白头翁","author":"陈颢","text":"老我年来两鬓秋，半因诗债半閒愁。\n不知山鸟缘何事，也向西风叹白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32468,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送澄上人南还","author":"高逊志","text":"东南多名山，可望不可即。\n兵尘浩无际，焉敢妄行役。\n如何浮屠师，周览思振锡。\n而道不在远，去去欲谁觅。\n名相既虚假，空焉访遗迹。\n真源浩无穷，寻流安有极。\n古来超世人，观妙向空壁。\n欲了第一机，终当绝闻得。\n幻尽始知幻，待彼众缘息。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32469,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"适兴","author":"高逊志","text":"神理固莫测，阖辟无时停。\n万物盈两间，森然咸委形。\n荣悴从大化，胡为劳其生。\n悠悠念往时，飞空如流星。\n先哲邈难逮，抚已空无成。\n严霜被中园，蔓草犹青青。\n晨夕自游目，亦足陶吾情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32470,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"高逊志","text":"退之少苦贫，干禄颇浮躁。\n长安三献书，时宰终不报。\n饥寒日哀鸣，踰壮已瞆眊。\n向非董张徒，宦辙谁与导。\n少年屡摧抑，大器天所造。\n苟不涉患难，尤足长雄骜。\n嗟余樗散材，时迈未闻道。\n虽云寡知己，敢忘固穷操。\n徇利多乞墦，贾名争媚灶。\n薄俗谅如斯，何事伤怀抱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32471,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以杜少陵文章憎命达之句析而为韵赋此 其一","author":"高逊志","text":"违世甘濩落，抚已徒忧勤。\n既通金闺籍，方思策奇勋。\n胡为竟杀融，复与沮溺群。\n念往每惩咎，纵学求多闻。\n朝饮西涧水，暮宿东山云。\n境静息疲薾，心清遗垢氛。\n森然富藻思，载道非空文。\n尚赖特立操，千载扬清芬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32472,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以杜少陵文章憎命达之句析而为韵赋此 其二","author":"高逊志","text":"积雨满污渎，蛭螾聊自藏。\n盲飙振修薄，篦簬依崇冈。\n动植各生遂，伊人独何伤。\n谪居穷田野，与世殊相忘。\n缅怀昔忧患，发短心日长。\n所愿免饥渴，孰敢谋膏粱。\n户庭罕游迹，琅然诵文章。\n欢来意自得，遐想超黄唐。\n从此遂閒逸，投老终徜徉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32473,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以杜少陵文章憎命达之句析而为韵赋此 其三","author":"高逊志","text":"鳣鲸击洪涛，一跃龙门登。\n惊风落潮汐，失势投冈陵。\n鬐鬣日已槁，穷涸何由兴。\n翻为猵獭笑，敢望馀波腾。\n畸人感物理，冥思多所徵。\n云翔避矰弋，渊潜避笱罾。\n胡为徇世务，轗轲常兢兢。\n勖哉保素履，勿贻人所憎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32474,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以杜少陵文章憎命达之句析而为韵赋此 其四","author":"高逊志","text":"荆璞不善藏，轻售与时竞。\n虽无泣玉耻，弃捐掩光瑩。\n伊余昧先几，妄往成蹭蹬。\n贪得违素心，徇名忘积行。\n通籍曾几时，三年绝朝请。\n久暌徒侣欢，转失乡党敬。\n剥丧匪偶然，且委时与命。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32475,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]